This is a placeholder for the shield.ico file.
You can create a proper .ico file using any icon editor.

For now, you can:
1. Use any online favicon generator to create an .ico from the logo
2. Use the logo.png as a starting point
3. Create a 256x256, 128x128, 64x64, 48x48, 32x32, and 16x16 icon

Recommended: Convert the Atlant Security logo to an icon format.
